    <div class="col-12">
        <nav aria-label="breadcrumb">
            <ol class="breadcrumb">
                <li class="breadcrumb-item"><a href="/">Home</a></li>
                <li class="breadcrumb-item"><a href="/erp">ERP</a></li>
                <li class="breadcrumb-item active">Dashboard</li>
            </ol>
        </nav>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-3">ERP Executive Dashboard & Enterprise KPIs</h1>
        <p class="lead mb-4">
            Unified command and control center for the modern enterprise, aggregating real-time data 
            from all operational modules into actionable strategic intelligence.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Centralized Operational Awareness</h2>
        <p>
            The ERP Dashboard eliminates information fragmentation by consolidating critical data from 
            finance, inventory, procurement, and projects into a single visual interface. This 
            centralized awareness allows leadership to monitor the health of the entire 
            organization at a glance, identifying trends and anomalies as they occur rather than 
            waiting for month-end reports.
        </p>
        <p>
            Visualizations are updated in real-time as transactions are processed in the field, 
            ensuring that executive decision-making is always based on the most current 
            commercial reality.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Strategic KPIs and Metrics</h2>
        <p>
            Monitor the metrics that drive enterprise value. Track liquidity ratios, AR turnover, inventory 
            aging, and procurement cycle times across different business units. Automated KPI 
            thresholds trigger alerts for management intervention when performance metrics drift 
            outside acceptable parameters, supporting proactive organizational governance.
        </p>
        <p>
            Custom dashboard layouts allow for role-specific views, ensuring that finance, 
            operations, and supply chain executives see the data most relevant to their 
            strategic priorities.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Inter-Departmental Intelligence</h2>
        <p>
            Understand the relationships between different functional areas. See how procurement delays 
            are impacting project timelines, or how sales growth is straining inventory levels 
            in specific regions. This cross-module intelligence is the hallmark of a mature 
            ERP implementation, allowing for synchronized organizational response to 
            market challenges and growth opportunities.
        </p>
        <p>
            Drill-down capabilities allow executives to move from a high-level KPI directly 
            to the underlying transaction data, providing the evidence needed for 
            deep-dive operational analysis.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row">
    <div class="col-lg-12 text-center">
        <p class="small mb-0">
